1
00:00:00,395 --> 00:00:02,055
And turned into a puddle of goo.

2
00:00:02,264 --> 00:00:06,094
Now, we can either sit around
and cry over spilt professor...

3
00:00:06,334 --> 00:00:11,604
...or we can rejoice in the knowledge
that a tenured position has just opened up.

4
00:00:12,841 --> 00:00:14,471
I choose to do the latter.

5
00:00:14,943 --> 00:00:17,843
(Sheldon:)Excuse me,
the whole tenure system is ridiculous.

6
00:00:18,046 --> 00:00:21,876
(Sheldon:)A guaranteed job for life only encourages
the faculty to become complacent.

7
00:00:22,084 --> 00:00:23,984
(Sheldon:)If we really want science to advance...

8
00:00:24,219 --> 00:00:27,449
(Sheldon:)...people should have chips
implanted in their skulls...

9
00:00:27,656 --> 00:00:30,456
(Sheldon:)...that explode
when they say something stupid.

10
00:00:32,494 --> 00:00:36,824
(Raj:)Well, I believe people do their best work
when they feel safe and secure.

11
00:00:41,103 --> 00:00:43,633
(Barry:)If you need my nose,
you'll find it firmly lodged...

12
00:00:43,872 --> 00:00:46,362
...up the rectum of the tenure committee.

13
00:00:47,375 --> 00:00:50,105
You PhDs gonna go suck up like Kripke?

14
00:00:50,312 --> 00:00:53,972
(Leonard:)No. I mean, I'll apply,
but I'm not gonna stoop to playing politics.

15
00:00:54,182 --> 00:00:56,312
(Raj:)Yeah, me neither.
It should be about the work.

16
00:00:56,518 --> 00:00:59,508
(Raj:)And if I can't get tenure,
I'd like to see you or Sheldon get it.

17
00:00:59,754 --> 00:01:04,024
(Sheldon:)Raj, don't dangle false hope
in front of Leonard like that.

18
00:01:04,993 --> 00:01:12,023
(Leonard:)Excuse me, but I think I'm just as qualified
as you are.

